{"name":"Big Cheese","hex":"#e9d035","fetched":"2026-10-23","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"big cheese","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A very important figure, especially a high-ranking person in an organization."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/big_cheese"}],"entries":[{"title":"Big Cheese (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Big Cheese is an English hardcore punk band from Leeds, West Yorkshire. They are a part of the New Wave of British Hardcore. In an article for Metal Hammer, Jimmy Wizard included their song \"Rotter\" in his \"essential hardcore mixtape\"."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Big_Cheese.jpg/330px-Big_Cheese.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Cheese_(band)","wikidata":"Q85747057"},{"title":"Bayside (band)","blocks":[{"text":"Bayside is an American punk rock band from the Bayside, Queens, neighborhood of New York City, formed in 2000 by lead vocalist Anthony Raneri. The group also consists of lead guitarist Jack O'Shea, bassist Nick Ghanbarian, and drummer Chris Guglielmo."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg/330px-Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bayside_(band)","wikidata":"Q812627"},{"title":"Cheese","blocks":[{"text":"Cheese is a type of dairy product produced in a range of flavors, textures, and forms by curdling of milk, usually from cows, goats or sheep, and sometimes of water buffalo. During production, milk is usually acidified and either the enzymes of rennet or bacterial enzymes with similar activity are added to cause the protein casein to coagulate. The solid curds, consisting of proteins and milkfat, are then separated from the liquid whey and pressed into finished cheese. Some cheeses have aromatic molds on the outer layer or rind, while others have them throughout."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Cheese_platter.jpg/330px-Cheese_platter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheese","wikidata":"Q10943"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Big_Cheese.jpg/500px-Big_Cheese.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Big_Cheese.jpg/1280px-Big_Cheese.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d1/Big_Cheese.jpg/500px-Big_Cheese.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABig_Cheese.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg/500px-Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg/1280px-Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/9/95/Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg/500px-Bayside_%28Band%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ABayside_(Band).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Cheese_platter.jpg/500px-Cheese_platter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Cheese_platter.jpg/500px-Cheese_platter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A platter with cheese and garnishes","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACheese_platter.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thu